{"id":"n50371-1-7","stage":5,"title":"때다 · 烧","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50371-1-7-1","ko":"방이 너무 추워요.","zh":"房间太冷了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방이","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"추워요.","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c34bc24f9140988f4e0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n50371-1-7-2","ko":"지금 방에 불을 때고 있으니 금방 훈훈해질 거다.","zh":"正在烧火给房间供暖，很快就会暖起来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방에","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불을","meaning":"火","explanation":"불：火；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"1","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때고","meaning":"烧","explanation":"때다：烧；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"때다","audio":"/audio/4274b28ccbc255a21eb1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50371","senseId":"1","lemma":"때다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立刻，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立刻，立马","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"3","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"훈훈해질","meaning":"暖和，暖烘烘；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"훈훈하다：暖和，暖烘烘；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"훈훈하다","audio":"/audio/1b1e1109368712ee5057.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89282","senseId":"1","lemma":"훈훈하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거다.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间",